{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2022-05-24 08:05:00', 'title': 'ORACLE ENHANCES ITS COMPREHENSIVE CLOUD SECURITY CAPABILITIES WITH INTEGRATED THREAT MANAGEMENT', 'text': "NEW CAPABILITIES FORTIFY DEFENSES ACROSS ORACLE CLOUD INFRASTRUCTURE (OCI) AND THE ORACLE APPLICATIONS STACK TO HELP CUSTOMERS PROTECT THEIR APPLICATIONS AND DATA AUSTIN, TEXAS , MAY 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ORACLE IS EXPANDING THE BUILT-IN SECURITY SERVICES AND CAPABILITIES OF\xa0ORACLE CLOUD INFRASTRUCTURE (OCI)\xa0TO HELP CUSTOMERS PROTECT THEIR CLOUD APPLICATIONS AND DATA AGAINST EMERGING THREATS. FIVE NEW CAPABILITIES ROUND OUT OCI'S ALREADY COMPREHENSIVE SECURITY OFFERING, INCLUDING A NEW BUILT-IN AND CLOUD-NATIVE FIREWALL SERVICE AND ENHANCEMENTS TO ORACLE CLOUD GUARD AND ORACLE SECURITY ZONES."}